{
  "info": {
    "_postman_id": "ebf102da-4464-409a-b7f4-ad943ac642d0",
    "name": "FoodExpress API - Sabiha + ALL RabbitMQ",
    "description": "Original FoodExpress API Gateway collection, updated for fresh Sabiha test users and all RabbitMQ checks. Included flows: Order→Cart (order.created), Order→Delivery (order.confirmed), Delivery→Order (delivery.status.changed), Payment→Order (payment.success). Use API Gateway at http://localhost:8080. Run folders in order.",
    "schema": "https://schema.getpostman.com/json/collection/v2.1.0/collection.json"
  },
  "item": [
    {
      "name": "00. READ ME - RabbitMQ Test Sequence",
      "item": [
        {
          "name": "Test Sequence Instructions",
          "request": {
            "method": "GET",
            "header": [],
            "url": "http://localhost:8080",
            "auth": {
              "type": "noauth"
            },
            "description": "RUN IN ORDER:\n\n01 Authentication: Register/Login Sabiha, Sabiha Restaurant Owner, Sabiha Deliveryman.\n02 Restaurant: Create restaurant + menu.\n03 Cart: Add Item → Get Cart. SKIP legacy manual Clear Cart.\n04 Order: Place Order → RabbitMQ Verify 1 (cart auto-cleared). Then CONFIRMED → RabbitMQ Verify 2A (delivery auto-created). SKIP legacy manual OUT_FOR_DELIVERY and DELIVERED Order requests.\n05 Payment: Create Payment → SUCCESS → RabbitMQ Verify 3 (Order payment auto-synced).\n06 Delivery: SKIP legacy manual Create Delivery Tracking. Assign deliveryman → out_for_delivery → verify Order → delivered → verify Order.\n\nRabbitMQ dashboard: http://localhost:15672 (guest / guest)."
          }
        }
      ]
    },
